OL,3,GNEWSAInquest into death of Lucy Letby's
OL,4,A'boyfriend' opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a doctor referred to as
OL,7,Fthe "boyfriend" of serial killer Lucy
OL,8,FLetby at her trial was possibly
OL,9,F"unnatural", an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FDr Mark Deakin, 53, from Winsford,
OL,12,FCheshire, was found collapsed in his
OL,13,Fcar on 24 June and was rushed to
OL,14,Fhospital where he died nine days later.
OL,16,FDeakin worked alongside Letby, now 36,
OL,17,Fat the Countess of Chester Hospital
OL,18,Fduring the period in which she murdered
OL,19,Fseven babies and attempted to murder
OL,20,Fseven others in 2015 and 2016.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
